    {
      "t": 184418,
      "step": "d10 breakdown",
      "body": "Wall length × height − doors and windows = m². Litres = m² × coats ÷ coverage, rounded up to 0.1 L, then the cheapest whole tins.\n\nLiving room · Wall 1 5.50 × 2.7 m − 2.16 m² (1 opening) = 12.69 m²\nLiving room · Wall 2 4.00 × 2.7 m − 1.44 m² (1 opening) = 9.36 m²\nLiving room · Wall 3 5.50 × 2.7 m − 3.42 m² (2 openings) = 11.43 m²\nLiving room · Wall 4 4.00 × 2.7 m − 1.71 m² (1 opening) = 9.09 m²\nBedroom · Wall 1 3.50 × 2.7 m = 9.45 m²\nBedroom · Wall 2 3.50 × 2.7 m = 9.45 m²\nBedroom · Wall 3 3.50 × 2.7 m − 1.44 m² (1 opening) = 8.01 m²\nBedroom · Wall 4 3.50 × 2.7 m − 1.44 m² (1 opening) = 8.01 m²\nKitchen · Wall 1 2.00 × 2.7 m = 5.40 m²\nKitchen · Wall 2 3.50 × 2.7 m − 1.20 m² (1 opening) = 8.25 m²\nKitchen · Wall 3 2.00 × 2.7 m = 5.40 m²\nKitchen · Wall 4 3.50 × 2.7 m = 9.45 m²\nTintEX Cashmere Interior Latex · Pastel green: 42.57 m² × 2 coats ÷ 10 m²/L (est.) = 8.6 L + 10% = 9.4 L → 2× 5 L = ",
      "rows": 12,
      "orders": [
        "TintEX Cashmere Interior Latex · Pastel green: 42.57 m² × 2 coats ÷ 10 m²/L (est.) = 8.6 L + 10% = 9.4 L → 2× 5 L = Rs 2,220 (0.6 L over) · Pastel Shades (estimated from the colour depth)",
        "TintEX Cashmere Interior Latex: 34.92 m² × 2 coats ÷ 10 m²/L (est.) = 7.0 L + 10% = 7.7 L → 1× 5 L + 3× 1 L = Rs 1,835 (0.3 L over)",
        "TintEX Mastertop: 28.50 m² × 2 coats ÷ 12 m²/L = 4.8 L + 10% = 5.3 L → 1× 5 L + 1× 1 L = Rs 1,812 (0.7 L over)"
      ]
    },
